    "title": "One run, four checkpoints: Map + potential (bug)",
    "note": "The same training run, scored at four points (25-30 episodes each, on the evaluation protocol before the fixed worlds), moves by 1.08 achievements. That is the scale of noise any comparison between single runs has to beat.",
