  "interpretation": [
    {
      "heading": "1. A map helps a little; the potential shaping helps more",
      "body": "With the imagination bug fixed, the map model alone (map, fixed: 4.73) is level with vanilla (4.63) and plain (4.77). Adding the tech-tree potential lifts it to 5.47, and the recipe and death fixes to the potential to 6.17 (privileged control). Among the map runs the potential is what makes the wood pickaxe: 33% of episodes with it against 10% without (the privileged control, oddly, never makes one while placing a table in 97%). Without WAKE_UP the honest map still leads plain by 1.4 achievements."
    },
    {
      "heading": "2. Observation-only targets cost nothing",
      "body": "Training RSSM-2 only on what the agent has seen (honest map, 6.17) matches the privileged control trained on the true map of every cell (6.17), and the honest run makes the wood pickaxe in 40% of episodes where the control never does. So the full-map labels were not what the map model needed."
    },
    {
      "heading": "3. The RSSM-2 fixes did not explain the result",
      "body": "The 2026-10-11 audit found three RSSM-2 bugs, including training seeing up to 7 future steps. The honest map rerun with every fix scores 5.70 against 6.17: within the noise of one score. The map model's contribution was not driven by the leak."
    },
    {
      "heading": "4. RSSM-2 as a memory alone is not established",
      "body": "On plain DreamerV3 with no shaping, RSSM-2 as a memory (predict RSSM-1's latent ahead, recall the observation back) adds +0.57 on the test worlds but trains slightly below plain. One seed; the two measures disagree, which is what noise looks like. It is the memory mode the goal-manager families build on."
    },
    {
      "heading": "5. Hand-written survival rewards hurt",
      "body": "The five survival terms ('shaped') collapsed the map run to 2.33: each term opened a cheaper way to earn than the behaviour it was meant to encourage. Potential-based shaping, which cannot change the optimal policy, replaced them. Survival itself is still unsolved: lifespans stay near the random band (251-304 steps)."
    },
    {
      "heading": "6. What would settle the rest",
      "body": "More seeds of the honest map on the fixed code and of abl_rssm2, and the potential without the map (on plain DreamerV3) to separate the two. The rule mask and the goal manager, which reach 8-11 achievements on top of RSSM-2, are on family/masked, family/v and family/next."
    }
  ],
